        'The TL-SG105PE is a small switch with five Gigabit ports, four of which deliver power over the network cable (PoE+). It powers access points, IP phones or cameras and can separate networks by VLAN.',
        [['Ports', '5 × Gigabit, 4 with PoE+'], ['PoE budget', '65 W total'], ['Management', 'VLAN, QoS, web interface'], ['Form', 'compact, metal case']],
        [['Is 65 W enough?', 'For two access points and two phones usually yes. Add up your devices\' figures.'], ['What does VLAN bring?', 'Guests, cameras and office computers can be kept apart even on the same switch.'], ['Do I have to configure it?', 'No, it works right away. Management is only needed for VLANs and fine-tuning.']],
        $bodyEn('A ceiling access point or an IP phone needs power and network. A small PoE switch supplies both over one cable.', ['Power and network over one cable', 'VLANs for separate networks', 'Small enough for any shelf'], ['Only five ports', 'Limited PoE budget for many devices'], 'Small offices with one or two access points, IP phones or cameras.'),
    )),

