        'logitech-mx-keys-mini-keyboard',
        'Logitech MX Keys Mini',
        'Compact backlit wireless keyboard without a number pad: more room for the mouse.',
        'Logitech MX Keys Mini assessed: compact backlit wireless keyboard for up to three devices. For small desks and more ergonomic working.',
        'The MX Keys Mini is a compact backlit wireless keyboard without a number pad. The mouse moves closer to the centre of the body, which eases shoulder and arm. It switches between up to three devices.',
        [['Form', 'compact, no number pad'], ['Connection', 'Bluetooth, up to 3 devices'], ['Backlight', 'automatic, with proximity sensor'], ['Charging', 'USB-C']],
        [['Will I miss the number pad?', 'If you type many numbers, for example in bookkeeping, the full-size MX Keys S is the better pick.'], ['Is there a German layout?', 'Yes. Look for the QWERTZ variant when buying.'], ['Does it work with Mac and Windows?', 'Yes, with both and with tablets.']],
        $bodyEn('A short keyboard is one of the simplest ergonomic improvements. The MX Keys Mini types like the full MX Keys but takes far less space.', ['Same typing feel as the full MX Keys', 'Mouse closer to the body, a more relaxed posture', 'Fits in a laptop bag too'], ['No number pad', 'No USB receiver included'], 'Small desks, laptop workstations and anyone who types few numbers.'),
