        'Curved 34-inch ultrawide with USB-C: two windows side by side, one cable to the laptop.',
        'Dell 34 Plus S3425DW assessed: curved 34-inch ultrawide monitor with WQHD and USB-C. Replaces two screens without a bezel in the middle.',
        'The Dell 34 Plus S3425DW is a curved 34-inch ultrawide monitor with WQHD resolution. It shows two windows comfortably side by side and connects to the laptop via USB-C.',
        [['Size', '34 inch, 21:9, curved'], ['Resolution', 'WQHD (3440 × 1440), 120 Hz'], ['Ports', 'USB-C, HDMI'], ['Suited to', 'spreadsheets, editing, several windows']],
        [['Ultrawide or two monitors?', 'Ultrawide if you want long timelines or wide spreadsheets without a bezel in the middle. Two monitors if you like one in portrait.'], ['Is my desk big enough?', 'Allow about 80 cm of width and enough depth for viewing distance.'], ['Does it charge my laptop?', 'Via USB-C, yes. Check that the power suits your laptop.']],
        $bodyEn('An ultrawide replaces two monitors without the distracting bezel in the middle. The S3425DW brings that at a fair price and with USB-C.', ['Lots of workspace without a centre bezel', 'USB-C for picture and power', 'Comfortable curve for looking at the edges'], ['Needs a deep, wide desk', 'VA panel: slightly narrower viewing angles than IPS'], 'Work with wide spreadsheets, timelines or many windows side by side.'),
    )),
    $p('peripherie', 'B09738CV2G', 'Elgato', 'makro,produktivitaet,controller', $t(
        'elgato-stream-deck-mk2',
        'Elgato Stream Deck MK.2',
        '15 frei belegbare Tasten mit Display: wiederkehrende Abläufe mit einem Druck starten.',
        'Elgato Stream Deck MK.2 eingeschätzt: 15 programmierbare Displaytasten für Makros, Programme und Videocalls. Produktivitätshelfer auch außerhalb des Streamings.',
        'Das Stream Deck MK.2 hat 15 Tasten mit kleinen Displays, die Sie frei belegen. Ein Druck öffnet Programme, fügt Textbausteine ein, schaltet das Mikrofon stumm oder startet ganze Abläufe.',
        [['Tasten', '15, mit eigenem Display'], ['Anschluss', 'USB'], ['Software', 'Stream Deck für Windows und macOS, mit Plugins'], ['Geeignet für', 'Makros, Videocalls, Textbausteine']],
        [['Ist das nur für Streamer?', 'Nein. Im Büro startet es Programme, Ordner, Textbausteine und Teams- oder Zoom-Funktionen.'], ['Reichen 15 Tasten?', 'Ja, dank Ordnern und Profilen pro Programm passen deutlich mehr Aktionen hinein.'], ['Brauche ich Programmierkenntnisse?', 'Nein. Aktionen werden per Drag and Drop belegt.']],
        $bodyDe('Wer jeden Tag dieselben Klickfolgen macht, spart mit festen Tasten Zeit und Nerven. Das Stream Deck ist dafür das ausgereifteste Gerät.', ['Tasten zeigen, was sie tun', 'Große Auswahl an Plugins für Büro-Software', 'Profile wechseln automatisch je Programm'], ['Lohnt sich erst mit etwas Einrichtungszeit', 'Braucht einen freien USB-Port'], 'Für Selbstständige und Büros mit vielen wiederkehrenden Handgriffen am Rechner.'),
    ), $t(
        'elgato-stream-deck-mk2-controller',
        'Elgato Stream Deck MK.2',
        '15 assignable display keys: start recurring workflows with one press.',
        'Elgato Stream Deck MK.2 assessed: 15 programmable display keys for macros, apps and video calls. A productivity tool well beyond streaming.',
        'The Stream Deck MK.2 has 15 keys with small displays that you assign freely. One press opens apps, inserts text snippets, mutes the microphone or runs whole workflows.',
        [['Keys', '15, each with its own display'], ['Connection', 'USB'], ['Software', 'Stream Deck for Windows and macOS, with plugins'], ['Suited to', 'macros, video calls, text snippets']],
        [['Is it only for streamers?', 'No. In the office it launches apps, folders, text snippets and Teams or Zoom functions.'], ['Are 15 keys enough?', 'Yes, folders and per-app profiles fit far more actions.'], ['Do I need programming skills?', 'No. Actions are assigned by drag and drop.']],
        $bodyEn('Anyone repeating the same click sequences every day saves time and nerves with dedicated keys. The Stream Deck is the most mature device for that.', ['Keys show what they do', 'Large choice of plugins for office software', 'Profiles switch automatically per app'], ['Pays off only after some setup time', 'Needs a free USB port'], 'Freelancers and offices with many recurring actions at the computer.'),
    )),

