        $bodyEn('Paper picked up on the road often stays in the bag for weeks. A mobile scanner digitises it at once.', ['Light, with no power adapter', 'Even scans without shadows or distortion', 'Searchable PDFs'], ['Single-sided and sheet by sheet only', 'Too slow for large stacks'], 'Field staff, consultants and freelancers who want to capture receipts on the spot.'),
