        $bodyEn('A lost USB stick with client data is a reportable data breach. A stick with a PIN turns it into an annoying loss without further consequences.', ['Encryption without software', 'Works on Windows, Mac and Linux', 'Rugged dust- and water-resistant case'], ['Pricier than ordinary sticks', 'Losing the PIN means losing the data'], 'Law firms, practices, consultants and anyone carrying client data on USB sticks.'),
